    rt_gate_never_existed_on_origin_hook_requires_it_2026-08-18, 4, "2026-11-09 p3-mine2: structural half RESOLVED; re-baseline DECISION still required, row kept open. (a) scripts/check/check-no-direct-rt.shs + allowlist + baseline are committed on release/1.0.0 and wired as blocking push gate push-no-direct-rt in scripts/check/check-push-must-pass.shs:955 (--roots src --rev --baseline-rev: delta ratchet against the push-range base, so pushes with new direct-rt debt are blocked without the frozen baseline blocking zero-debt branches). (b) Standalone full run is honestly RED: --roots src forbidden=6753 vs baseline 6290 (463 over, top offenders rt_criticality_validation.spl, generated/hir_codec.spl, llvm_backend.spl); default widened roots (2026-08-28) forbidden=27780 vs 6290. No safe quick paydown subset identifiable in this pass; either a 463-site migration lane or a deliberate --generate-baseline re-baseline (script forbids verification runs from rewriting the baseline) is an owner decision. Full roots re-baseline would ratchet ~21.5k of unclassified debt - not done here."

